| Parameter | Type |
| ------ | ------ |
| \`options\` | \\{ \`name\`: \`string\`; \`nested\`: \\{ \`deep\`: \`boolean\`; \\}; \`onChange?\`: (\`value\`: \`number\`) => \`void\`; \\} |
